    "name": "luh-supplementary-data-dressieren-richten",
    "notes": "This set provides supplementary data for the final report of the DFG project \"Untersuchung des kombinierten Einflusses des Dressierens und Rollenrichtens von D\u00fcnnblech aus Materialien mit unterschiedlichem Kristallgitter auf die Mikrostruktur, Textur, statische und Erm\u00fcdungsfestigkeit\" (project number 290141559).\r\n\r\n\r\n- 290141559_tensile_data.zip\r\n  The data set includes tensile test data for DC01, copper, and titanium in the initial condition and after different bending loads. \r\n\r\n- 290141559_hysteresis_data.zip\r\n  The data set includes cyclic hysteresis data for DC01, copper, and titanium for different skin passing loads. \r\n\r\n- 290141559_cyclic_bending_XRD.zip\r\n  The data set includes XRD texture data for DC01, copper, and titanium after different bending loads.",
